1
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:18,270
♪I stretch and yawn
when the sun is high in the sky♪

2
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:23,030
♪A cup of tea and a little tune,
what a carefree life♪

3
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:28,480
♪The fortune teller said
love would come my way this year♪

4
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:32,580
♪But all I see is my food
arriving right on time♪

5
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:35,670
♪No rush, no worries♪

6
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:38,360
♪Love is all a matter of chance♪

7
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,480
♪Flowers bloom and fade♪

8
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:43,380
♪I'd rather take good care
of myself first♪

9
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:45,580
♪Two orioles sing among
the green willows♪

10
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,970
♪And I still don't have a boyfriend♪

11
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:50,590
♪My best years are nothing
to worry about♪

12
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:53,240
♪I'll stay happily single
till I'm old and gray♪

13
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:07,540
=Besties' Coming Fortune=

14
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:09,980
=Episode 10=

15
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:11,000
Get away from me!

16
00:01:20,070 --> 00:01:21,510
So I wasn't the only one.

17
00:01:25,230 --> 00:01:25,920
You scoundrel.

18
00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:27,060
You liar!

19
00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:29,080
How many women have you deceived?

20
00:01:36,150 --> 00:01:37,230
How dare you bite me?

21
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:39,640
Then I'll deal with you first!

22
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:52,430
You...

23
00:01:53,310 --> 00:01:54,360
Weren't you drugged unconscious?

24
00:01:59,510 --> 00:01:59,870
It's...

25
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,080
It's a sedative.

26
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:02,150
I'll pass out first.

27
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:03,760
I'm counting on you after that.

28
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:12,270
Oh, come on.

29
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:13,700
Still trying to escape?

30
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:26,640
You rotten scoundrel.

31
00:02:27,150 --> 00:02:28,110
Rotten to the core.

32
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:29,610
There's a huge market for men.

33
00:02:29,610 --> 00:02:30,810
You could make money
painting them from either side.

34
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:32,270
Why don't you paint yourself?

35
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:34,230
What are you waiting for?

36
00:02:34,700 --> 00:02:35,550
How dare you refuse to help me?

37
00:02:35,870 --> 00:02:36,480
Tomorrow,

38
00:02:36,630 --> 00:02:37,630
I'll make sure your nude portrait

39
00:02:37,630 --> 00:02:38,870
is seen throughout the capital.

40
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:44,670
You still dare say that?

41
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:49,870
Want me to squeeze

42
00:02:49,870 --> 00:02:50,590
that giant pimple

43
00:02:50,590 --> 00:02:51,880
on your neck?

44
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:11,320
What? I haven't finished
giving him the medicine.

45
00:03:23,630 --> 00:03:24,710
He, stop hitting him.

46
00:03:25,910 --> 00:03:26,990
If you kill him now,

47
00:03:27,590 --> 00:03:28,880
you'll only bring trouble upon yourself.

48
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:30,920
Get out.

49
00:03:33,190 --> 00:03:33,830
Out!

50
00:03:46,750 --> 00:03:47,320
Shen He,

51
00:03:51,030 --> 00:03:51,820
he's still useful.

52
00:03:52,700 --> 00:03:54,140
Death would be too easy for him.

53
00:04:00,910 --> 00:04:01,640
Are you all right?

54
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:04,160
As long as you're okay.

55
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:06,920
As long as you're okay.

56
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:10,990
Let's get out of here first.

57
00:04:17,070 --> 00:04:17,760
Let's get out.

58
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:25,950
Have you forgotten?

59
00:04:26,430 --> 00:04:27,510
You were kidnapped just yesterday.

60
00:04:27,510 --> 00:04:28,590
And today, you came here alone.

61
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:30,150
What if I'd arrived a moment later?

62
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:34,390
Look.

63
00:04:34,830 --> 00:04:36,000
I went up the mountain

64
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,680
to gather these herbs
to replace Immortal Heart Herb.

65
00:04:38,310 --> 00:04:39,200
Sanqi told me

66
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:40,240
your antidote

67
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,710
only needs this one last ingredient.

68
00:04:42,510 --> 00:04:42,880
Here.

69
00:04:45,630 --> 00:04:46,950
So you left the estate

70
00:04:48,870 --> 00:04:50,120
just to find an antidote for me?

71
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:50,510
That's right.

72
00:04:51,640 --> 00:04:52,410
Now

73
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:54,680
your poisoning can be cured for good.

74
00:04:55,590 --> 00:04:57,570
Even if we separate one day,

75
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:59,560
you won't have to worry
about the poison anymore.

76
00:05:05,870 --> 00:05:06,710
Separate?

77
00:05:11,190 --> 00:05:13,020
So you went through all this trouble

78
00:05:13,520 --> 00:05:14,910
just so you could leave me?

79
00:05:16,300 --> 00:05:17,240
♪On whose fingertips♪

80
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:20,160
♪Does the wind come to rest?♪

81
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:22,150
Aren't you missing the point?

82
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,830
I found the antidote for you.

83
00:05:23,830 --> 00:05:25,030
You should be happy.

84
00:05:26,630 --> 00:05:27,270
Besides,

85
00:05:29,950 --> 00:05:31,800
we were always going to separate.

86
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:35,950
Ever since that night

87
00:05:35,950 --> 00:05:37,240
you took my medicine,

88
00:05:37,950 --> 00:05:39,030
you've belonged to me.

89
00:05:41,430 --> 00:05:42,680
I won't let you leave me.

90
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:43,270
Do you understand?

91
00:05:45,810 --> 00:05:49,310
♪Light hides within your eyes♪

92
00:05:51,440 --> 00:05:56,700
♪My reason is slowly giving way♪

93
00:05:59,320 --> 00:05:59,980
No.

94
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:02,800
We can't be together.

95
00:06:04,570 --> 00:06:07,600
♪An unnamed passion begins to burn♪

96
00:06:07,730 --> 00:06:08,370
Why not?

97
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:10,040
Is it because I used to

98
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:10,910
treat you badly

99
00:06:12,180 --> 00:06:13,080
and see you only as my antidote?

100
00:06:15,420 --> 00:06:15,980
Don't worry.

101
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:19,030
I'll never hurt you again.

102
00:06:20,510 --> 00:06:21,510
That's not why.

103
00:06:23,630 --> 00:06:24,470
Then why?

104
00:06:25,630 --> 00:06:26,800
(Because your childhood sweetheart,)

105
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:28,140
(the girl who once saved you,)

106
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:30,470
(the novel's true heroine,)

107
00:06:31,080 --> 00:06:32,440
(will be back soon.)

108
00:06:33,620 --> 00:06:37,350
♪Like an act of redemption♪

109
00:06:37,460 --> 00:06:40,740
♪Let all reason be destroyed♪

110
00:06:40,740 --> 00:06:44,040
♪Even if we're reduced to ashes♪

111
00:06:44,470 --> 00:06:45,580
♪In this tender uncertainty♪

112
00:06:45,580 --> 00:06:49,860
♪Whoever speaks first
falls deeper in love♪

113
00:06:50,020 --> 00:06:52,700
(Shen Manor)

114
00:07:04,510 --> 00:07:05,080
Your Lordship.

115
00:07:05,510 --> 00:07:06,030
Terrible news.

116
00:07:06,270 --> 00:07:06,880
Pei Qian has escaped.

117
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:07,870
The guards on duty last night

118
00:07:07,870 --> 00:07:08,510
dozed off.

119
00:07:08,630 --> 00:07:09,560
When they woke up, he was gone.

120
00:07:09,830 --> 00:07:11,040
I've already sent men after him.

121
00:07:11,830 --> 00:07:12,390
This is bad.

122
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,440
Knowing what he's capable of,

123
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:14,310
he'll definitely try

124
00:07:14,310 --> 00:07:15,280
to take me down with him.

125
00:07:17,830 --> 00:07:18,600
Grandmother,

126
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:19,910
I know I was wrong.

127
00:07:20,070 --> 00:07:21,430
Pei Qian threatened me

128
00:07:21,430 --> 00:07:22,150
with those paintings.

129
00:07:22,430 --> 00:07:23,470
If I didn't give him money,

130
00:07:23,720 --> 00:07:25,350
he'd make them public,

131
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:26,880
ruining my reputation

132
00:07:27,070 --> 00:07:28,520
and disgracing the Marquis's Manor.

133
00:07:30,760 --> 00:07:32,030
How could you be so foolish?

134
00:07:40,160 --> 00:07:41,830
Though you're
an adopted daughter of our family,

135
00:07:42,430 --> 00:07:43,240
I've always

136
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:45,910
loved you like my own granddaughter.

137
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:49,630
You've suffered such
a terrible injustice.

138
00:07:49,880 --> 00:07:51,110
Why didn't you tell me?

139
00:07:51,620 --> 00:07:52,880
Instead, you chose

140
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:55,120
to harm your two sisters-in-law.

141
00:07:55,950 --> 00:07:56,640
Grandmother,

142
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:58,470
I've made a terrible mistake.

143
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:00,270
Once this matter is settled,

144
00:08:00,830 --> 00:08:02,150
I'll enter a convent of my own accord

145
00:08:02,430 --> 00:08:04,240
and spend the rest of my life
praying for the Marquis's family.

146
00:08:04,870 --> 00:08:05,800
But now,

147
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:06,900
I'm afraid Pei Qian

148
00:08:06,900 --> 00:08:07,920
might come after us out of spite

149
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:09,440
and ruin the family's reputation.

150
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:09,720
I...

151
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:10,240
Wanwan,

152
00:08:14,070 --> 00:08:15,270
you're the victim here.

153
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:17,150
Even if Pei Qian comes after us,

154
00:08:17,270 --> 00:08:18,390
he'll only ruin his own reputation.

155
00:08:18,510 --> 00:08:19,200
Exactly.

156
00:08:22,110 --> 00:08:23,420
Stop asking yourself why.

157
00:08:23,950 --> 00:08:25,000
Start asking
what gives others the right.

158
00:08:26,070 --> 00:08:26,560
Grandmother,

159
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:28,350
I think

160
00:08:29,750 --> 00:08:31,470
we should stand together against him.

161
00:08:32,630 --> 00:08:34,060
- Messing with these two
- Do you have a solution?

162
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:35,360
means you've met your match.

163
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,400
Yuyuan.

164
00:08:36,870 --> 00:08:37,390
Shutiao.

165
00:08:37,390 --> 00:08:38,720
Of course there's a way.

166
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:40,350
Come here.

167
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:43,400
Later, I...

168
00:08:47,670 --> 00:08:48,750
What are you two doing?

169
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:51,350
Come over here.

170
00:08:51,730 --> 00:08:52,990
Isn't Wanwan your younger sister?

171
00:08:53,740 --> 00:08:55,680
Shutiao, you don't have to defend me.

172
00:08:56,090 --> 00:08:57,520
I've done so many wrong things.

173
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:59,430
It's only natural that my brothers

174
00:08:59,570 --> 00:09:00,520
dislike me.

175
00:09:01,150 --> 00:09:01,990
I always judge

176
00:09:02,390 --> 00:09:03,560
actions, not people.

177
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:05,110
You did nothing wrong in this matter.

178
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:06,800
As your second brother,

179
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:08,830
I won't let Pei Qian get away with this.

180
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:10,040
Count me in.

181
00:09:11,050 --> 00:09:12,400
I haven't had enough
of beating him yesterday.

182
00:09:12,870 --> 00:09:13,760
I'm itching for another round.

183
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:14,560
Good.

184
00:09:15,390 --> 00:09:16,520
First,

185
00:09:19,150 --> 00:09:20,040
when the time comes...

186
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:23,110
Then...

187
00:09:26,810 --> 00:09:27,550
Finally...

188
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:37,400
Will this plan work?

189
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:38,590
Don't worry.

190
00:09:39,960 --> 00:09:41,400
I'm going to show him

191
00:09:42,480 --> 00:09:43,230
that women

192
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:47,800
aren't to be messed with.

193
00:09:49,460 --> 00:09:50,480
(Shen Manor)

194
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:51,470
Ladies and gentlemen,

195
00:09:51,910 --> 00:09:53,110
come and take a look.

196
00:09:54,270 --> 00:09:55,630
The fourth young lady
of the Marquis's Manor,

197
00:09:55,910 --> 00:09:56,800
Shen Wanwan,

198
00:09:57,030 --> 00:09:58,110
is a woman of loose morals.

199
00:09:58,270 --> 00:09:59,630
Not only has she

200
00:09:59,910 --> 00:10:01,350
been intimate with me repeatedly,

201
00:10:01,630 --> 00:10:02,710
she even

202
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:03,920
took off her clothes

203
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:04,920
and asked me to paint her.

204
00:10:06,300 --> 00:10:07,470
Do you think it's true?

205
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:12,110
How disgraceful.

206
00:10:12,600 --> 00:10:14,230
How could such a thing happen
in the Marquis's family?

207
00:10:15,630 --> 00:10:17,160
You claim the woman
in this painting is my sister.

208
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:18,490
Where's your proof?

209
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:21,520
The unique birthmark

210
00:10:21,700 --> 00:10:22,960
on the woman's wrist in this painting

211
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:23,680
is undeniable proof.

212
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:24,870
Shen Wanwan,

213
00:10:25,820 --> 00:10:27,320
do you dare roll up your sleeve

214
00:10:27,550 --> 00:10:28,710
and show everyone your wrist?

215
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:40,120
♪No matter how
the universe changes tomorrow♪

216
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:47,320
♪Right now,
I just want to stay by your side♪

217
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:52,520
♪Let this kiss and this dream
last until we're old♪

218
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:58,760
♪And hold on to all
the tenderness of this moment♪

219
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:05,200
♪Following this heartbeat,
we'll retrace our steps♪

220
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:11,680
♪As time goes by,
all I need is your gaze♪

221
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:16,320
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪

222
00:11:35,080 --> 00:11:38,440
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪
